  "content": "<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1434265336365973565/1435731067339542579/IMG_8630.jpg?ex=690d0841&amp;is=690bb6c1&amp;hm=7c033fc6892d55757f7f1c42289b5c2d03f82a94aabcf747890d7f480ba70429&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;width=1221&amp;height=676\" alt=\"標誌\" width=\"793\" height=\"439\"></p><p>「從火星來任何東西的機會是百萬分之一，但它們還是來了……」</p><p>免責聲明：此模組仍在開發中，並非所有內容皆已完成，您可能會遇到錯誤。</p><p>沒有人知道，在廣闊的方塊狀太空彼岸，存在著高度智慧與先進的生物正注視著我們。如同在顯微鏡下研究生物般，他們記錄著我們日常生活的點滴。漸漸地，他們策劃著接管這個地球的計劃。&nbsp;</p><p>「火星入侵」Minecraft 模組讓您有機會在 Minecraft 中體驗源自 H.G. 威爾斯於 1897 年所著小說《世界大戰》的多重宇宙。此模組提供三種不同版本供遊玩，每個版本皆有其獨特的風格與恐怖氛圍，並由 TheCheezyCheez 重新混音或原創配樂。</p><p>版本包括：&nbsp;</p><p>(1978) 音樂劇版本</p><p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1397790520910282763/1403889420943491193/Untitled136_20250809195450.jpg?ex=690c8ca8&amp;is=690b3b28&amp;hm=a0cd10d629bb73c2d3d12a12be842d46f6385bb172c72775f9b554d8aaa9a3fa&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;width=676&amp;height=676\" width=\"360\" height=\"360\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/agWRUWfgtO4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span>1978 音樂劇版本特色：</span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tk8WEM_gOJg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span>戰鬥機器：</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1434265336365973565/1435736080430137384/Adobe_Express_-_file_1.png?ex=690d0cec&amp;is=690bbb6c&amp;hm=be949c569c2f43bc76ac139b92373623e24f2cf1c7243874b07f5d94e7804de6&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;quality=lossless\" alt=\"\" width=\"220\" height=\"294\"></p>\n<p>飛行機器：&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1434265336365973565/1435738057117532333/Animated_flying_machine_2.png?ex=690d0ec3&amp;is=690bbd43&amp;hm=d53cb9c94137d21be61a26a645248bf4278ccad736584f7b2dd98a310805a486&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;quality=lossless\" alt=\"\" width=\"385\" height=\"335\"></p>\n<p>處理機器：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1434265336365973565/1435738314153132145/Handlingmachine.png?ex=690d0f00&amp;is=690bbd80&amp;hm=418bc42bffe20245e12ad8f43cbf8ebfd3d7870c610c023818837fa2befce459&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;quality=lossless\" alt=\"\" width=\"586\" height=\"306\"></p>\n<p>圓柱體：<img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1434265336365973565/1435737780859834521/Cilindarcutscene.png?ex=690d0e81&amp;is=690bbd01&amp;hm=2864fc7d8766bea729fe11595be8e061e7ccef65ec4b8e2c64d0d47ea19f1782&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;quality=lossless&amp;width=140&amp;height=350\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"350\"></p>\n<p>紅草：&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1397790520910282763/1424925347190673469/2025-10-06_21.04.00.png?ex=690c9ce4&amp;is=690b4b64&amp;hm=92e28e0910741b1c9bb1df2bf44a07095c37af4a40ca5501f299970a14c9ad9f&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;quality=lossless&amp;width=1202&amp;height=676\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"626\">原聲帶連結：&nbsp;<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://soundcloud.com/thekillercheez/sets/war-of-the-worlds-minecraft?ref=clipboard&amp;amp;p=a&amp;amp;c=1&amp;amp;si=33928804962b40a29672596375d6cc1e&amp;amp;utm_source=clipboard&amp;amp;utm_medium=text&amp;amp;utm_campaign=social_sharing&nbsp;</a></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(2005) - 即將推出……</p><p>(2019) - 即將推出……</p><p>每個宇宙都帶來其獨有的恐怖與挑戰，例如紅草、火星人、收割機器等。在入侵中生存下來，讓人類的精神永存！&nbsp;<br><br>若任何公司如 JEFF WAYNE MUSIC GROUP LIMITED / PARAMOUNT PICTURES / MAMOTH SCREEN / BBC 要求我下架此模組，我將遵從其要求。</p>",
